'''Ultimate Echo Echo''' is the [[Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of a [[Sonorosian]].

==Appearance==
===Ben as Ultimate Echo Echo===
Ultimate Echo Echo has a tall blue body with black stripes, an overall rounded design, long arms and legs, and stumped feet. He is not a robot or containment suit, despite his body now looking more metallic.{{Refn|A fan once asked [[Dwayne McDuffie]] if [[Echo Echo]] was either a robot or some kind of living containment suit, and then shared a theory that Echo Echo's being is actually living sound waves for a containment suit to hold; Dwayne responded on September 22, 2008 by saying "Echo [Echo] is a member of a race that just looks like that".{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Transformation Duration.PNG]]|group = DM|name = archive}} Later, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] would claim multiple times that Echo Echo was in fact a containment suit housing living sound waves while answering fan questions,{{Refn|[[:File:Conductoid Containment Suit.png]]|group = DJW|name = link2}}{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Living Sound.png]]|group = DJW|name = link}} while specifying that he did not come up with the concept,{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Living Sound 2.png]]|group = DJW}} and got it from Dwayne McDuffie.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Containment coming from Dwayne.png]]|group = DJW}} Due to the contradictions between Dwayne and Derrick, Echo Echo is no longer considered by the wiki to have a containment suit. Following his logic with Echo Echo, Derrick claimed that Ultimate Echo Echo was also living sound within a containment suit.{{Refn|[[:File:Ultimate Echo Echo Containment Suit.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}} Unlike his devolved counterpart, Ultimate Echo Echo has fifteen blue, removable [[Sonic Disc|speaker-like components]] attached to his body and a marking on his back resembling a cassette tape.  Ultimate Echo Echo wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

===Albedo as Negative Ultimate Echo Echo===
[[Albedo|Negative]] Ultimate Echo Echo has red eyes and red cables that attach from his back to his hands. His head is wide and angular, with a smaller mouth; a silvery forehead; and black "ears" on the sides. His Sonic Discs are red instead of blue and they look like his head, not having a sunken look to them. Two of the spikes on the [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] symbol, which look more tubular, connect to the discs on his chest, and a third one seems to crawl up the side of his neck. He also has black stripes on his stomach and legs.

