====[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]====
Ultimate Echo Echo is a playable alien in all versions of the video game but only on a small section in the [[Amazon|Amazon base]] to defeat an army of [[Robotic Extermination Device]]s. Strangely, he has five fingers instead of four.

Ultimate Echo Echo can launch his Sonic Discs at enemies, send two discs out to make a shockwave on far away enemies, and spin sonic discs around him, damaging any nearby enemies in a small radius, then making a shockwave, damaging all nearby enemies.

He can dash forward, punching through enemies. He moves around by floating above the ground.

====[[Ben 10: Galactic Racing]]====
Ultimate Echo Echo is a playable racer in the game. He fires sonic discs at his opponents.

