==Trivia==
*Ultimate Echo Echo's mouth does not move when he speaks except when he uses his sonic screams or expresses his emotions.
**Negative Ultimate Echo Echo never spoke in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', becoming the only [[Ultimate Forms|Ultimate form]] used in that series to not have any dialogue.
*Whenever Echo Echo goes Ultimate, any Echo Echo clones active at the time will transform into [[Sonic Disc]]s.<ref name="TEoME" /> However, if all Echo Echo clones go Ultimate at the same time, they will instead merge into Ultimate Echo Echo.<ref name="GfT" />
*[[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] thinks Ultimate Echo Echo's name should be "Ultimate Echo Ultimate Echo" instead.<ref name="MoI" />
*Ultimate Echo Echo was the [[Alien of the Month]] in November 2011.
**However, in Australia, [[Ultimate Kevin]] took Ultimate Echo Echo's place during that time.
*In ''[[FusionFall]]'', there is a helmet based on Ultimate Echo Echo that can be bought inside [[Ship]].
*Ultimate Echo Echo was replaced by his devolved form for the '''Omniverse''' version of ''[[Game Creator]]''.
*Ultimate Echo Echo first appeared in ''[[Fashion Victim]]'', a non-canon [[Comics|comic]] released as a tie-in for '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', before his on-screen debut in ''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''.
*Ultimate Echo Echo's '''Ultimate Alien''' design was created by [[Steven Choi]], a process which he found to be difficult.{{Refn|[[:File:Steven choi designed Ultimate Echo Echo.PNG]]|group = SC}}
**Ultimate Echo Echo's '''Omniverse''' design was created by Steven alongside [[Chap Yaep]] and Dou Hong.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's work on the Ultimate forms.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Ultimate Echo Echo was originally supposed to appear in ''[[Escape From Aggregor]]'' to fight [[Galapagus]] after [[Ultimate Big Chill]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/6/60/EFA Script Outline.pdf ''Escape From Aggregor'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
*Ultimate Echo Echo was originally not supposed to appear in:
**''[[Basic Training]]'', with his role taken by [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/31/Basic Training Draft-1.pdf ''Basic Training'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}
**''[[The Perfect Girlfriend]]'', with his role taken by [[Armodrillo]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/7/75/Perfection DRAFT-1.pdf ''Perfection'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = draft1}}{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/26/The Perfect Girlfriend DRAFT-2.pdf ''The Perfect Girlfriend'' Script Second Draft]|group = script|name = second}}
**The dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night of the Living Nightmare Script First Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}

